Third-party components

This product bundles or depends on third-party components distributed under
their own licenses. Notable items:

* rhwp (HWP/HWPX parser, MIT License) — https://github.com/edwardkim/rhwp
  Used through the `rhwp_py` PyO3 binding (backend/native/rhwp_py) and the
  `@rhwp/core` WASM package (frontend, extensions/hwp_render_server).
  HWP/HWPX test samples under `samples/hwp/` originate from that repository.

* PyMuPDF (AGPL-3.0 or commercial) — optional, not bundled.
  Imported lazily by the `vlm` parsing strategy and image tooling. It is not a
  required dependency and is not distributed with this product; installing it
  subjects that component to its own license terms. See docs for alternatives.
